### 01. Отримати JWT токен ADMIN
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/dev-token?username=bohdan_admin&roles=ADMIN,MECHANIC

> {% client.global.set("admin_token", response.body.access_token); %}

### 02. Отримати JWT токен MECHANIC
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/dev-token?username=taras_mechanic&roles=MECHANIC

> {% client.global.set("mechanic_token", response.body.access_token); %}

### 03. GET /api/vehicles БЕЗ токена -> 401 Unauthorized
GET http://localhost:8080/api/vehicles

### 04. GET /api/vehicles З JWT (MECHANIC) -> 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8080/api/vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{mechanic_token}}

### 07. SecurityFilterChain: MECHANIC -> /api/admin/stats -> 403 Forbidden
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{mechanic_token}}

### 09. @PreAuthorize: MECHANIC -> DELETE /api/vehicles/2 -> 403 Forbidden
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/vehicles/2
Authorization: Bearer {{mechanic_token}}

### 10. @PreAuthorize: ADMIN -> DELETE /api/vehicles/2 -> 204 No Content
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/vehicles/2
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
